The bundled line editor defines _rl_free_history_entry with a void return
in misc.c, but search.c declares int. Match its definition so WebAssembly
callers use the same function signature. This corrects an upstream C
prototype inconsistency without changing history behavior.

--- a/extra/readline/search.c
+++ b/extra/readline/search.c
@@ -61 +61 @@
-extern int _rl_free_history_entry PARAMS((HIST_ENTRY *));
+extern void _rl_free_history_entry PARAMS((HIST_ENTRY *));
